# A Federation destroyer on layouts/move.jsonc gets a move order: the dump while it drives shows move=<x>,<z>, and the
# dump after it has arrived shows move=none at the point.
# Run it with --layout layouts/move.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
# The point is in the frame of the dump's pos= field, whose z is the layout z mirrored.
wait 1
select Mover
wait 0.3
move 2000 -2200
wait 1
dump driving
wait 30
dump arrived
